msgid "CARTA_texto"
msgstr "To my grandchild, with love:\n\nIf you're reading this, the ranch is yours now. You'll find it in a sorry state: the years are unforgiving and I no longer had the strength to look after it. But the grill is still standing, and a good grill can fix anything.\n\nI'm leaving you my savings, two thousand pesos, and my secret: low heat, patience and never pierce the meat. Sell your barbecue, fix up the grill shelter, the table, the old well… and make El fogón de los sueños full of people again.\n\nYour grandpa"

